{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfrvh8nAWxKcqFBT36xk7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The refactor is done and the existing tests pass (5 of 5 with `python -m pytest -q tests`). I did not commit anything.\n\n**What changed** (all under `export/`):\n\n- **`registry.py`** (new): the `Exporter` ABC with `name`, `extension`, and `dump(records)`, plus `register` (usable as a decorator), `get(name)`, `names()`, and `UnknownFormat`. `register` rejects a missing name or a duplicate.\n- **`formats/csv.py`, `formats/json.py`, `formats/xml.py`** (new): one `@register`ed `Exporter` subclass each, with the same output as the old if-chain branches.\n- **`formats/__init__.py`** (new): imports every module in the package with `pkgutil`, so the formats register on import. Adding a format means adding a file there.\n- **`core.py`**: `export_records` and `export_to_file` keep their signatures and now look the format up through `get()`. The if-chains and `_extension` are gone.\n- **`__init__.py`**: re-exports `export_records`, `export_to_file`, and `UnknownFormat`, and also exposes `Exporter`, `register`, `get`, and `names`. It imports `formats` so registration runs on `import export`.\n\n**Behaviour notes:**\n\n- The unknown-format message now lists the known names, e.g. `unknown format 'yaml'; known formats: csv, json, xml`. `UnknownFormat` still subclasses `ValueError`.\n- `export_to_file` still checks the format before opening any file and still appends the extension when missing.\n\n**Choices I made:**\n\n- The format modules are named `csv.py`, `json.py`, and `xml.py`. They don't shadow the stdlib because the imports are absolute.\n- `get()` returns the exporter class, not an instance. `core.py` instantiates it.\n- Duplicate registration raises instead of silently replacing the earlier format.\n\nI did not add tests for the registry itself beyond the existing five. Say if you want them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7610,"cache_read_input_tokens":47479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7610},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94c74f5c-f0a0-4053-b642-71325259fcec","uuid":"f48946a9-1c35-40b4-916c-52262ed4ac13","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:48:42.007Z","request_id":"req_011Cfrvh8WXzfC2AQbFDuPvV"}
